{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Great Adventure with Cirno!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One sunny morning in Gensokyo, Cirno awakens to find a notice posted outside her house...</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the adventure of Cirno and her friend Daiyousei in this turn-based battle RPG, as she ventures far and wide across the Misty Lake, spurred on by her goal: to discover the secrets of a new form of &quot;Ice&quot;, entirely unknown to her. Could it be even better than the ice she can conjure...?! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meeting the Inhabitants of Gensokyo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218680/extras/f36dcbb8dbd9b38b40e9ff72690da994.poster.avif?t=1769509071\" width=740 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218680/extras/f36dcbb8dbd9b38b40e9ff72690da994.webm?t=1769509071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218680/extras/f36dcbb8dbd9b38b40e9ff72690da994.mp4?t=1769509071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this journey, you will meet many familiar faces of the local populace. The game contains a great amount of interactions and cutscenes with in-engine usage of animations, emotes, movements, and other effects to set it apart from the standard dialogue fare; involving the many inhabitants of Gensokyo that Cirno will meet on her quest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fierce Foes to be Fought</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218680/extras/95a58ca535bb1ee35382d7f4aeb46f91.poster.avif?t=1769509071\" width=764 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218680/extras/95a58ca535bb1ee35382d7f4aeb46f91.webm?t=1769509071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218680/extras/95a58ca535bb1ee35382d7f4aeb46f91.mp4?t=1769509071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the Misty Lake, many aquatic dangers lie hidden just beneath the water's surface. Cirno will need to face them to reach the end of her journey and emerge victorious!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a growing repertoire of up to 5 different spells to defeat enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it is charged, activate <strong>Ice Mode</strong> to supercharge any one of your powers, temporarily turning it into a different kind of attack! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time yourself to the enemy's windups to be able to nimbly dodge almost any attack in the game. Every enemy has a set of unique attacks and animations to learn! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record your findings with Cirno's journal, an ingame bestiary of every frog Cirno has vanquished. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the residual magic of her spells, Cirno can charge up to 6 icicles to fire alongside her physical attacks! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all of these tools combined, you can emerge victorious, and defeat any amphibious foe that lies in your path!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Note</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This videogame is an unofficial fanwork of the Touhou Project. All content featured is within compliance of their guidelines for derivative works.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please support the original developer's titles, many of which are available on 